WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:48.920
Someone once said...

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:51.890
If you fire an arrow at a certain type of cow

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.090
and hit the center of its target, the 
quality of its steak meat increases...

00:01:58.090 --> 00:02:01.960
Bullseye Beef!

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:07.030
There's a mountain where green fruit 
roll down its cliff path and eventually,

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:12.870
if some of the fruit line up coincidentally 
like the windows in a slot machine,

00:02:12.870 --> 00:02:18.380
they'll miraculously ripen into mature 
fruit with a high sugar content...

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:22.620
Mount Slotmore!

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:26.290
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:31.190
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:36.760
Toriko and his comrades went to the Gourmet 
Casino in search of Meteor Garlic,

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.570
one of Toriko's training ingredients.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.500
Along the way, they joined up with Match 
and his men from the Gourmet Mafia,

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.670
who are there to eradicate 
illegal ingredients.

00:02:46.670 --> 00:02:51.580
In the VIP area, they encountered 
Livebearer, the owner of the Gourmet Casino

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.010
as well as the boss of the 
Underground Cooking World!

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:58.380
He challenged Toriko and company 
to a game where the stakes

00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:01.450
are his digitized memory of the 
flavor of Meteor Garlic on one hand

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.090
and all of their memories 
of food on the other!

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:05.690
Two cards are turned over.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:08.230
The person who gets a matching pair

00:03:08.230 --> 00:03:11.330
has to eat the same food that's on the cards.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:13.530
After the ingredient is devoured,

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:17.600
the person gets the number of 
points that are on the card.

00:03:18.270 --> 00:03:20.270
Well, the gist of it is you match cards,

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:22.340
eat a bunch of food, and at the end,

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.940
the player with the most points wins, right?

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:27.480
Alright, this game of Gourmet Concentration,

00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:30.010
Gourmet Tasting, is about to begin!

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.250
Coco went first and got a match 
with a pair of Cherry Apples.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.050
Toriko ate them and they received ten points!

00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:43.460
Dead Heat! Coco vs. Livebearer!

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:50.600
Alright, following the Cherry Apples, 
the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:53.200
got another hit and ate a Watermelon Clam!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:59.110
The next card chosen was a Smashroom, 
which is a 20-point ingredient...

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:01.710
Number 55.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.650
There it is! Another hit with Smashroom!

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:15.930
After Chef Komatsu prepares it and Toriko 
eats it, they'll get their points!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:19.500
If you tap a Smashroom like 
so, a spice spore comes out,

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:22.530
which makes it even tastier.

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:30.840
I can't get enough of that spicy scent!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:33.710
Have some creamed Smashroom!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.550
Thank you for the food!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.220
It's incredibly delicious!

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.260
Thanks again for the food!

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:56.100
Cherry Apples - 10
Watermelon Clam - 10
Smashroom - 20

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.500
Cherry Apples, Watermelon 
Clam, and Smashroom,

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:57.770
three hits in a row, right from the start!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:02.140
And they were all eaten, netting 
them a total of 40 points!

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:09.540
Yeah! We've got a 40-point 
lead from the get-go!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:15.520
Since they got three successful consecutive 
hits, it becomes Livebearer's turn.

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:19.990
Coco is an amazing guy...

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:24.890
I bet his eyesight is so incredible that 
he can pick up electromagnetic waves.

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:28.730
Or is it he's able to see what's gonna 
happen with his fortune telling?

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:33.670
Whatever it is, there's no man who 
can be depended on more than him.

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.100
Coincidence?

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.700
I think not.

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:44.280
The odds of picking three consecutive 
hits out of 56 cards...

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:48.380
is 148,665 to one...

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:54.090
With a figure like that, it's hard 
to believe this was just dumb luck.

00:05:54.090 --> 00:05:56.020
You know which cards match, don't you?

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.260
Well...

00:05:58.220 --> 00:05:59.730
That makes two of us, doesn't it?

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:03.530
Two of you?!

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:07.330
Just as I thought, it seems 
you're a worthy opponent.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:11.300
Dealer-san, number 32 if you would.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.310
Sausage Worm...

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.540
50 points?!

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:19.110
Number 16.

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:27.590
There it is! A hit! Sausage Worm!

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:30.060
That's a 50-point ingredient.

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:33.960
Uh-oh. With just one pair, 
he caught up and then some!

00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:36.630
I knew it...

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:41.830
Figures he'd cheat somehow, 
but right from the start?

00:06:43.200 --> 00:06:46.040
I have pride as a gambler.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.740
I would never stoop to cheating.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:53.740
The lie slipped from his mouth 
as easily as an exhaled breath.

00:06:53.740 --> 00:06:56.580
He was never the slightest bit 
concerned with having a fair match.

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:02.020
All he's about is the base 
desire to devour our memories.

00:07:04.660 --> 00:07:07.560
The Sausage Worm. Please eat the whole thing!

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:15.530
My men have been keeping an eye on the 
kitchen and ingredient storage room.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:20.570
But the moment we discover you've been 
cheating through some other means,

00:07:20.570 --> 00:07:24.310
we'll deal with you in an appropriate manner.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.440
Please, be my guest.

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:40.390
The Sausage Worm has been eaten!

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:44.890
Livebearer-sama gets 50 points, putting 
him in the lead with one stroke!

00:07:44.890 --> 00:07:47.500
Let's keep it going. Number four.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.070
Man-Faced Mushrooms! 70 points!

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:53.170
70 points?!

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.570
Next... let's say 36.

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.740
Man-Faced Mushrooms! Another hit!

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:05.880
He's gettin' consecutive 
high-point ingredients...

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.280
The higher the ingredient's points,

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:13.220
the more difficult it is 
to cook and consume them.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.790
The time limit to finish 
eating the ingredient

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.190
is what the card's points are in minutes.

00:08:18.190 --> 00:08:22.200
So if the 70 point Man-Faced Mushroom 
isn't completely eaten in 70 minutes,

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.230
it doesn't count!

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:27.400
In other words, the more difficult 
high-point ingredients are

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:31.570
to prepare and eat, the more 
time you're given to eat them.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:36.780
Incidentally, there are also lucky 
ingredients, which are worth a lot of points

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:39.480
but are easy to cook and eat.

00:08:39.850 --> 00:08:41.250
Lucky ingredients?

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:47.450
Although there's the opposite, 
too. Unlucky ingredients...

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:55.330
First joker ingredients, now 
lucky and unlucky ingredients?!

00:08:55.330 --> 00:08:59.500
I have a feeling the key 
to winning this thing

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.270
is how you deal with those 
three types of cards...

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:06.510
Consumed! Livebearer-sama gets 70 points!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:11.380
Number 37 and number three, please.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:15.110
Oh, boy! It's a lucky ingredient!

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:18.050
Melon Egg, a 100-point hit!

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.520
100 points?!

00:09:29.730 --> 00:09:32.030
And he easily finishes it off!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:38.240
In this one turn, Livebearer-sama 
has received a total of 220 points!

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.270
And now it's Coco's turn.

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.740
All of a sudden, 220 points...

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:46.510
I'm countin' on you, Coco!

00:09:51.150 --> 00:09:56.860
Unlike that cheating bastard Livebearer, 
Coco is getting hits through skill.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:09:59.090
There should be no problem.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.760
Faint electromagnetic waves are 
coming up through the cards.

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:07.470
I can picture their differences 
by sensing their color and shape.

00:10:08.930 --> 00:10:12.400
Perceiving colors at the same time 
you see numbers or letters...

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.410
It's what people call synesthesia.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:19.880
I'm using my synesthesia to discern 
the electromagnetic waves given off

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:22.780
by the cards and then match them up 
according to their colors and shapes.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:28.920
However, I don't know the kind of ingredient 
or the points with this method.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:33.860
Still, with these 12 cards 
drawn by Livebearer and me,

00:10:34.220 --> 00:10:37.660
I've got a pretty good image 
of cards that have high points.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:42.430
He knows what ingredients the cards 
are as well as their point value.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.930
I've got to be aggressive from early on.

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.800
Can't let there be a big 
point gap between us...

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:50.740
Coco... Hey, come on, man, I'm 
seriously countin' on you!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.840
Toriko, Komatsu-kun...

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:58.110
I'm the one who's counting on you.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:00.850
Somehow, you've got to choke it down.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:01.880
Right!

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:03.750
Leave that to me!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:07.160
Number 23... and number 44.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:16.930
There it is, Pudding Mountain!

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:20.900
He got a hit with a 150-point ingredient!

00:11:24.170 --> 00:11:28.780
I'm smellin' the sweet, powerful 
scent of vanilla and custard!

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:53.430
What the hell is this?!

00:11:56.700 --> 00:12:00.770
It's huge! This is Pudding Mountain!

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:04.810
It's like a real mountain! 
What an enormous ingredient!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:10.120
If this isn't consumed within the 150-minute 
time limit, the towel's thrown in!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.950
Eat all of this in 150 minutes?!

00:12:16.490 --> 00:12:18.860
Can you eat the whole thing?

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.130
Or would you like to give up once?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:24.830
Although two give-ups in 
a row and you're out...

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:44.820
Alright! The time limit is 150 minutes!

00:12:44.820 --> 00:12:48.450
Will Toriko devour this 
gigantic Pudding Mountain?

00:12:48.450 --> 00:12:52.360
Or will he choose to give up?!

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.760
Don't be stupid.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.260
Unfortunately for you, 
pudding is one of my faves.

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:01.800
I'll gladly eat the whole thing.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.900
Toriko-san!

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.870
I give thanks for all of 
this world's bounty...

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:08.640
Let's eat!

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:21.120
Delicious!

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:26.720
Made with plenty of eggs, milk, and 
sugar, it's got a rich sweetness!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:30.190
Now this is what I call pudding!

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:36.230
Delicious!

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.570
I knew you could do it, Toriko-san!

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:39.600
Well, well...

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.470
You're as much a glutton as ever, Toriko.

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:46.740
But is he going to be okay?

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.610
If he eats this amount at 
that kind of fever pitch...

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.080
I've got it!

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.320
There it is!

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.960
Toriko-san!

00:14:02.160 --> 00:14:03.190
What is it, Komatsu?

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.760
If you eat it too fast, your 
blood sugar level will rise!

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:11.470
I'm going to slap on some of 
this Mineral Shallot sauce,

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:14.700
which will adjust your sugar 
absorption and help you digest it!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:17.070
Gotcha! Thanks!

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:22.980
With Mineral Shallot sauce, plus Almond 
Cabbage and Banana Cucumber cream,

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.620
his blood sugar level will decrease and 
it'll change the flavor here and there,

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:30.220
so Toriko-san won't get sick 
of the flavor before he's done.

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:36.830
This part tastes like fragrant almonds!

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:45.770
Thank you for the food.

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:51.110
Consumed!

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:57.480
Amazingly, he leveled that towering 
Pudding Mountain in just 30 minutes!

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.750
You did it, Toriko-san!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:06.420
The Coco-Toriko-Komatsu team get 150 
points, for a total of 190 points!

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:10.490
They're closing in on Livebearer-sama, 
who's just 30 points ahead!

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:17.300
Yeah, Pudding Mountain was delicious!

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:20.100
We shortened the gap in one fell swoop!

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:22.800
Let's keep it going.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:26.640
Next, number 38 and number two.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.070
You got it.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.810
There it is! Summer Whiskey!

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:38.520
50 points... He matched up 
another high-point ingredient.

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.620
Are you sure?

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:45.120
After consuming one ingredient,

00:15:45.460 --> 00:15:51.200
you're allowed a five-minute break 
before choosing the next card.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:54.700
Summer Whiskey... Booze, huh?

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:58.270
It's a liquor made from Sun Durian, 
known as "the Sun's Blessing",

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:01.810
mixed with Planet Water, which can 
only be found deep underground,

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:03.980
and then cured for 30 years!

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:06.350
83% alcohol!

00:16:06.350 --> 00:16:08.910
That's some crazy-strong liquor right there!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:13.050
No matter how heavy the 
drinker or big the man,

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:14.790
that liquor will get you falling-down drunk.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:19.520
I think you ought to give Toriko 
at least that five-minute break.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:20.590
A break?

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.560
You don't know Toriko at all, do you?

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:33.040
Delish! Now this is booze with body!

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:34.910
It's warmin' me up from head to toe!

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:35.640
Oh!

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:38.710
Gimme another! I want some more of this!

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:42.850
No, you're done. You drank the whole bottle.

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:48.190
Incredibly, Toriko has already 
finished! That's 50 points!

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:51.120
Please have some snacks 
to go with it, Toriko-san.

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:54.020
This is damn tasty!

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:58.360
That's Cheese Cabbage...

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.300
What's your next card?

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:07.670
Right. Numbers seven and 49, please.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:12.380
And it's another hit, with 
70-point Bullet Acorns!

00:17:12.810 --> 00:17:13.980
Attaboy, Coco!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.280
Bullet Acorns...

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:21.380
They're nuts with a high Capture Level 
that become iron-hard if jostled,

00:17:21.380 --> 00:17:24.150
and launch themselves with 
the speed of a bullet!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:29.090
If you drop a Bullet Acorn on the 
ground, poison sprouts come out!

00:17:29.090 --> 00:17:31.860
Please catch it before it 
shoots into the ground!

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:43.610
Toriko-san!

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:49.780
Is this good enough? That was easy.

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:01.320
Here you are. Bullet Acorn stew.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:12.930
Exactly opposite from their name, these 
are tender and have a mild flavor!

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:14.700
Yummy!

00:18:18.210 --> 00:18:20.070
Thank you for the food.

00:18:21.110 --> 00:18:24.780
Consumed! They get 70 points!

00:18:24.780 --> 00:18:30.820
In this turn, the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team scored a total of 310 points!

00:18:30.820 --> 00:18:31.890
They came up from behind!

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:33.420
We did it!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.620
Yep!

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.660
Now do you understand, Livebearer?

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:40.930
This is Gourmet Hunter Toriko!

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:43.030
Well done.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:48.200
He ate all of those ingredients 
without giving up even once.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.940
I don't think anyone's ever done that before.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:57.140
And now I do understand that there's 
one more opponent I need to be wary of.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:00.610
I understand because I'm a chef.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.450
This man has exquisitely 
prepared all of the ingredients

00:19:03.450 --> 00:19:07.950
that Toriko ate as if it were nothing.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:10.860
Toriko doesn't realize it...

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:15.190
It's all thanks to him that Toriko was 
able to eat and enjoy the ingredients.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:20.330
Even with just six dishes, he 
can't hide his sophistication.

00:19:21.530 --> 00:19:23.740
I want to peek!

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:27.170
His gourmet history, his intellect, 
his philosophy, his beliefs!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:30.240
Just what does he have his sights set on?

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:33.980
The talent that's making me think all this...

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:36.510
I'm definitely going to steal it from him!

00:19:36.950 --> 00:19:40.790
I'll swipe the contents of that golden brain!

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.270
Well...

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.340
It's my turn, isn't it?

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.470
Here it comes...

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:05.040
There are 19 ingredients left!

00:20:11.380 --> 00:20:14.020
Now the real game begins.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:28.230
In those younger days,

00:20:28.230 --> 00:20:30.130
No matter how you chased them,

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:34.700
The sky-spanning rainbows got away

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:38.040
After that, time passed

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.510
Were you able to grasp

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:45.150
The rainbow by the name of dreams then?

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:48.850
When it comes to a new challenge,

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:54.090
You turn into a coward,

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:59.560
But your chance ain't gonna wait on you,

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:04.430
So now's the time!

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:12.110
Bet those tears and that kindness

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:16.340
Will light up tomorrow

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:19.410
That's right, rainbows are 
all the more beautiful

00:21:19.780 --> 00:21:23.250
Because we can't catch 'em

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.950
Today's Gourmet Tasting Lecture!

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:29.090
I'm your newscaster, Tina.

00:21:29.090 --> 00:21:31.560
We've got a heated Gourmet Tasting showdown!

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:34.900
In this segment, I'll give you 
a heaping helping of commentary

00:21:34.900 --> 00:21:36.830
on today's game and its important points!

00:21:40.030 --> 00:21:41.340
I don't mind doing commentary,

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:44.710
but I wasn't allowed to be the 
live announcer this week either.

00:21:46.970 --> 00:21:50.610
Right! Delivering commentary that's easy 
to understand is the linchpin of news!

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:52.250
Pardon me!

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:57.420
In the game, the Coco-Toriko-Komatsu 
team started first

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.420
and Coco got three hits in a row.

00:22:00.090 --> 00:22:01.650
Toriko ate 'em all!

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:08.030
Toriko's team scored 40 points.

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:11.130
Then it was Livebearer's turn to choose.

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:15.670
Livebearer also got three hits in 
a row and finished them all off.

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:23.710
Livebearer turned the tables on Toriko 
and company, scoring 220 points!

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:26.450
Then Toriko's team launched 
their counterattack!

00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:41.890
They scored 270 points for 
a total of 310 points!

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.060
Right now, they've got a 90-point lead!

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:46.670
And here's today's cool point!

00:22:48.700 --> 00:22:53.140
Gourmet Tasting cards include lucky 
ingredients, unlucky ingredients,

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:56.310
and joker ingredients, and the locations 
of these three types of cards

00:22:56.310 --> 00:22:58.740
will mean the difference 
between winning and losing!

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:01.010
There are 19 ingredients left.

00:23:01.680 --> 00:23:04.520
The real showdown has just begun!

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.990
Miss after miss. What's wrong, Coco?

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:12.120
Meanwhile, Toriko faces a terrifying ingredient.

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:14.160
Huh? Coco's smiling?

00:23:14.510 --> 00:23:17.290
Coco’s Gambit! the Ingredients That Determine Victory or Defeat!

00:23:17.620 --> 00:23:19.320
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
